```jsx
import { useState } from 'react';

export default function CartButton() {
  const [count, setCount] = useState(2);
  return (
    <button onClick={() => setCount(current => current + 1)}>
      Cart ({count})
    </button>
  );
}
```
The component describes the label for the current snapshot. A click queues a new snapshot; React handles the DOM update during commit.

